<title>INDIA: India Zandu Pharma bonus meet today.</title>
<headline>India Zandu Pharma bonus meet today.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The board of India's Zandu Pharmaceutical Works will meet today to consider a bonus share issue, the Bombay Stock Exchange (BSE) said in a notice on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The firm will also consider its accounts and dividend at the meeting, the exchange said.</p>
<p>-- Bombay equities desk +91-22-265 9000</p>
</text>
